{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-04_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-04","title":"恐れるなかれ","storyCode":"4-4","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"3705095a557dc9f9d20be8e69cdde25d092621652d34fb9943d3993889a760a8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ、はあ……っ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"な、なんとか……なりましたね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……いいえ、まだ終わりじゃないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"え……？　い、言われてみれば……塵みたいなものが、舞っているような……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、うっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あああああっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ひ……いたい……痛いい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ、うああっ……か、ゆい……痒い……痒い痒い痒い！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ア……ぁあアァ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ロド、ス……ロドスがいル……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"やツらは敵だ……こ、ろせェ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな……！　ど、どうして……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"さっき倒したはずなのに、また立ち上がってくるなんて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"おやおや？　もうくじけちゃったの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　奴のアーツユニットから、光が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"まだ何も始めてないんだけどなあ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"――う、嘘……増援まで来るなんて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"こうなったら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"なんとかして、私があの幹部を仕留めるしか……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"よせ、メテオリーテ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハッ、この状況で議論なんかしてる余裕があるのかい？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"すごい自信じゃないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"何とでも言いなさい。この一撃で黙らせてあげるから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――ダメだ。やめろと言ってるだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、ちょっと！　どうして止めるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"いいから、今すぐ撤退しろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……感じるんだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"奴らが、近付いているのを。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ？　撃たないの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"それは残念だなあ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"こんなチャンスはこれっきりだと思うんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……？　向こうも退いたみたい、だけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"メテオリーテ、今だ！　西にある、崩れかけの建物を撃て！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"！　敵の注意を逸らすってことね、任せて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"ジェシカ、走れ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……「スノーデビル」が来たんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"ほ、本当に、いきなり寒く……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……急げ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"今すぐここを離れるんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……ジェシカ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフの言う通り、撤退しましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、全力で走るわよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤ、聞こえるか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"応答願う。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"私が補助に回るから、あなたたちは先に行きなさい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――いいか、アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"ここには来るな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"この場所は――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["メフィスト"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["フロストリーフ"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["メテオリーテ"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["ジェシカ"]}]}
